wer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462407} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "685bde27-7c6e-5ce7-87d0-455573912944" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461309} {:answer/id #uuid "c8ba973d-89a4-5779-9566-6df1fb8f8fa9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461310}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "685bde27-7c6e-5ce7-87d0-455573912944" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461309} :answer-field/id #uuid "922cbb69-1b51-5210-8b87-056e25a5749f" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462408}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "016b340f-7aa5-5001-aeb3-927982c5cf50" :question/math-academy-id "q-104694" :question/problem "Which of the numbers below belong to ${Q}^{-}?$\n- **I.** $47$\n- **II.** $-\\sqrt{12}$\n- **III.** $\\sqrt{10}$\n- **IV.** $0$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "Remember that ${Q}^{-}$ is the set of all negative rational numbers.\n\n- $47$ is positive, not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $-\\sqrt{12}=-2\\sqrt{3}$ is not a rational number, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $\\sqrt{10}$ is positive, not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $0$ is not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is \"None of those listed\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240914 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abc6b3ee-0251-5c9c-9358-bd192c434dd1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Bel