* ${{20,22}}$\n- **III.** ${{0},{6,9,15}}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- ${-1,{12}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $-1\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\n- ${{20,22}}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- ${{0},{6,9,15}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element ${0}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240965 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172034 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1240e42a-92a5-51cc-a80e-3fe1ef0b16f7" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Codomains and Ranges"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "45778b4b-32eb-5857-9506-b9aa98925b5d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461371} {:answer/id #uuid "c9ae2265-b918-5303-af80-85171c306d46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461372}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c9ae2265-b918-5303-af80-85171c306d46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461372} :answer-field/id #uuid "7a1d712a-5f27-5dd5-b8fd-2fa271a2558d" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462439} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "252cc9c8-3077-50ad-b772-a795e67e39af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461373} {:answer/id #uuid "c8185970-ee2b-58a8-805f-19a7f3ebd6d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461374}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c8185970-ee2b-58a8-805f-19a7f3ebd6d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461374} :answer-field/id #uuid "c169ea22-33fb-5a2c-92c4-532fc512778b" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462440} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ce6d3007-552e-5f5b-83b5-cfe29e1024bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461375} {:answer/id #uuid "45b26448-f223-547a-b2a1-a9184a7bceea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461376}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce6d3007-552e-5f5b-83b5-cfe29e1024bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461375} :answer-field/id #uuid "bdc2aa6f-2778-5e8a-b235-f7d87b781287" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462441}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "caad9560-3559-5568-b085-de268d2408da" :question/math-academy-id "q-104945" :question/problem "Which of the following is the correct interpretation of $g:{0,1}\\to Z?$\n- **I.** The domain of $g$ is ${0,1}$\n- **II.** The codomain of $g$ is $Z$\n- **III.** The range of $g$ is ${0,1}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The notation \n\n$$\ng:{0,1}\\to Z\n$$\n\nmeans that the function $g$ maps the set ${0,1}$ to the set $Z.$ In this case,\n\n- the domain of $g$ is ${0,1},$ and\n\n- the codomain of $g$ is $Z.$ Note that ${0,1}⊆Z$ is *not* necessarily the range.\n\nAs a result, statements I and II are true, while statement III is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240966 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172034 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1240e42a-92a5-51cc-a80e-3fe1ef0b16f7" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Codomains and Ranges"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6858c349-e6bf-5e38-a585-15570d08376f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461377} {:answer/id #uuid "b7ed67d9-c399-5b60-8a5b-b97ed7ff9399" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461378}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6858c349-e6bf-5e38-a585-15570d08376f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461377} :answer-field/id #uuid "b55dd236-1315-5f0c-a08b-715c05b2bb35" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462442} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71b439da-0fe4-5815-b359-792909931b63" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461379} {:answer/id #uuid "2d1a5447-5793-5cd5-840d-50b22c61bc72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461380}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d1a5447-5793-5cd5-840d-50b22c61bc72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461380} :answer-field/id #uuid "7fa6cf5b-6383-5006-ad7b-4465277c422a" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462443} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f7709721-24eb-5f08-81a5-384dc9ee7c60" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461381} {:answer/id #uuid "45b2be3d-93a1-55b7-8fa4-f0eeed9d2b31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461382}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f7709721-24eb-5f08-81a5-384dc9ee7c60" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461381} :answer-field/id #uuid "91e72ba0-42e0-5b90-aa54-1925c2cb5b15" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462444}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ece458da-55a3-56bf-9d0d-49bed0ba9d3c" :question/math-academy-id "q-104946" :question/problem "Which of the following is the correct interpretation of $g:Q\\to R?$\n- **I.** The domain of $g$ is $R$\n- **II.** The codomain of $g$ is $R$\n- **III.** The range of $g$ is $Q$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The notation \n\n$$\ng:Q\\to R\n$$\n\nmeans that the function $g$ maps the set $Q$ to the set $R.$ In this case,\n\n- the domain of $g$ is $Q,$ and\n\n- the codomain of $g$ is $R.$ Note that $Q⊂R$ is *not* necessarily the range.\n\nAs a result, statements I and III are false, while statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240968 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172034 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1240e42a-92a5-51cc-a80e-3fe1ef0b16f7" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Codomains and Ranges"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6cd5dc92-6122-5f66-902b-cf7afd5b3037" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461383} {:answer/id #uuid "a4df0471-5db6-5210-9df4-d5ba3514d0e2" :answer/type {: